WEBVTT

00:00.842 --> 00:02.342
[Alt+Shift+C opens the table of contents, with focus on the current section]

00:03.112 --> 00:04.612
[Tab to the next section]

00:04.797 --> 00:06.297
[Alt+Shift+2 shows 2 levels]

00:07.047 --> 00:08.547
[Alt+Shift+1 shows only the top level]

00:09.314 --> 00:10.814
[Alt+Shift+0 shows all levels]

00:11.566 --> 00:13.066
[Alt+Shift+F goes to Find a section]

00:13.116 --> 00:14.616
[types “Russia”, which narrows the sections]

00:16.279 --> 00:17.779
[Enter opens the first match, “3.9 Valentin Haüy in Russia”]
